# ---- Go ----
# Binaries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
bin/
CLAUDE.local.md
dist/
# NOTE: a bare `typesafe` pattern would match any file OR DIRECTORY of
# that name at any depth, which silently excluded the whole cmd/typesafe
# source tree. The built binary is ignored by the specific path below.
cmd/typesafe/typesafe
cmd/typesafe-gen/typesafe-gen
# `go build ./cmd/...` from the repo root drops the binaries here, not in
# their package directories. Anchored to the root so nothing under cmd/
# is excluded.
/typesafe
/typesafe-gen

# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html
profile.cov

# Vendored deps (we keep zero deps; ignore if someone runs it locally)
vendor/

# Go workspace (local only)
go.work
.claude/
go.work.sum

# ---- Cassette hygiene ----
# Never commit recorded cassettes containing real keys
testdata/raw/
CLAUDE.md
testdata/cassettes/*.secret.json

